  "description": "<p>This task is to enable fixity checks on Federated content.</p>\n\n<p>A couple of use cases:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>resources in our digital preservation store (Archvematica AIP store), as noted above</li>\n\t<li>large files/datasets that we don't want to store in F4 itself<br/>\nThe first is speculative, but the second reflects the way we currently store a lot of data with F3 and at the moment have no checksums or fixity checking.</li>\n</ul>\n",
